","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539524/68777539524.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539524/5395240320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539524/5395240319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539524/5395240318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539524/5395240317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539524/5395240316.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Dr. Lal PathLabs Limited reported its un-audited financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, achieving a quarterly revenue of Rs. 798 crore which represents a 19.1% year-on-year growth. Management highlighted that this revenue growth was driven by 10.7% sample volume growth and 8.2% patient volume growth. The company reported an EBITDA of Rs.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects early to mid-teens revenue growth in FY27.","quote":"We are entering FY27 with strong operational momentum, a strengthened digital infrastructure, and a clear pathway towards sustaining early to mid-teens revenue growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects EBITDA margins to be in the range of 27% to 28% for next year.","quote":"While for the next year, as we are closing this year 27.2%, even after taking the one-time charge of Rs. 30 crore on account of new Labour Code. So, we are hopeful for next year also, we are looking something similar margin like between 27% to 28%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Preventive healthcare brand Swasthfit contributed 27% to total revenue in FY26.","quote":"Our preventive healthcare brand, Swasthfit, contributed 27% to our total revenue in FY26, proving to be a critical lever for B2C growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company executed its expansion plan for the year by adding 14 new labs and more than 1,100 collection centers.","quote":"On the operational side, we successfully executed our expansion plan for the year, adding 14 new labs and more than 1,100 collection centers.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"},{"claim":"Management plans a capex range of Rs. 100 crore to Rs. 120 crore for the next year.","quote":"Anshul, for capex, I think we are planning to be in the range of Rs. 100 crore - Rs. 120 crore kind of capex for the next year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"},{"claim":"The total deal size for the acquisition of Shahbazkers asset is about Rs. 20 crore.","quote":"Total deal size is about Rs. 20 crore for this asset.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"EBITDA for Q4 FY26 was Rs. 187 crore with an EBITDA margin of 26.6%.","quote":"• EBITDA for Q4 FY26 came in at Rs. 187 crore compared to Rs. 169 crore in Q4 FY25, registering a growth of 10.5% with an EBITDA margin of 26.6%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"},{"claim":"Full year EBITDA stood at Rs. 752 crore with a margin of 27.2%.","quote":"• The full year EBITDA stood at Rs. 752 crore compared to Rs. 696 crore in FY25, registering a growth of 8.2% with a margin of 27.2%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company operates 312 clinical labs, 7,727 Patient Service Centers, and 13,935 Pick-up Points as of June 30, 2026.","quote":"As on March 31, 2026, DLPL’s has 312 clinical labs (including National Reference Lab at Delhi & Regional Reference Lab at Kolkata, Bangalore & Mumbai), 7,727 Patient Service Centers (PSCs) and 13,935 Pick-up Points (PUPs).","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=2a358926-2b70-4761-9a90-2c6ea6265103.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Working capital is negative by 26 days.","quote":"Our commitment to operational excellence is reflected in our lean working capital, which is negative by 26 days.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"},{"claim":"The Board of Directors approved a final dividend of Rs. 4 per share.","quote":"• Further, I am pleased to share that the Board of Directors have approved the final dividend of 40%, that is Rs. 4 per share, taking the total dividend for the year to Rs. 20.5 per share, that is 280% after adjustment of bonus issue of 1:1 in Q3 FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"A one-time cost of Rs. 30 crore related to the new Labour Code was accounted for in Q3 FY26.","quote":"1. One-time cost of Rs. 30 crore related to the new Labour Code, which was accounted for in Q3 FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company aims to sustain early to mid-teens revenue growth entering FY27.","quote":"We are entering FY27 with strong operational momentum, a strengthened digital infrastructure, and a clear pathway towards sustaining early to mid-teens revenue growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company plans to be in the range of Rs. 100 crore to Rs. 120 crore for capex next year.","quote":"Anshul, for capex, I think we are planning to be in the range of Rs. 100 crore - Rs. 120 crore kind of capex for the next year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e9fbf8bd-fd52-4d89-813a-1d42d3c15af6.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":14,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":7,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}